  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ゆき",
    "text": "「あ、先輩」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ゆき",
    "text": "「お金をくれませんか？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ゆき",
    "text": "「…………」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 38,
    "dress": "old-default",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-default_expression/sad",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 0,
      "y": 474
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ゆき",
    "text": "「あれ、変なこと言いましたか。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ゆき",
    "text": "「ごめんなさい、わたし喋るのが面倒で――いろいろ省略してしまう、悪い癖があるようです」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 38,
    "dress": "old-default",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-default_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 0,
      "y": 474
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ゆき",
    "text": "「ちょっと今ハマっているソーシャルゲームがあるんですが、」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ゆき",
    "text": "「テクニックだけではどうにもならない難問が発生しまして。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 38,
    "dress": "old-default",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-default_expression/sad",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 0,
      "y": 474
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ゆき",
    "text": "「最近のは、何かこう、」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ゆき",
    "text": "「『誰でも楽しめる』を追究するあまりテクニックの介在する余地がなくて、ゲーマーとしては寂しいです」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 38,
    "dress": "old-default",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-default_expression/joyful",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 0,
      "y": 474
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ゆき",
    "text": "「ということで、お金をください」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 38,
    "dress": "old-default",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-default_expression/amazed",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 0,
      "y": 474
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ゆき",
    "text": "「えっ？　まだ意味がわからない？　はあ……困ったひとですね」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 38,
    "dress": "old-default",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-default_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 0,
      "y": 474
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ゆき",
    "text": "「ですから、こういうゲームで先に進むためには、」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ゆき",
    "text": "「お友達を増やして人海戦術を用いるか、もう廃人になるまで課金するしかないわけです。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ゆき",
    "text": "「でも、わたしお友達をつくるのが苦手なので、お金を得るしかない、ということです」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 38,
    "dress": "old-default",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-default_expression/surprise",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 0,
      "y": 474
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ゆき",
    "text": "「え？　お金はあげられないけど、友達にはなれる？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 38,
    "dress": "old-default",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-default_expression/sad",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 0,
      "y": 474
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ゆき",
    "text": "「何ですか、そんな話はしてないでしょう、変なひとですね」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 38,
    "dress": "old-default",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-default_expression/angry",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 0,
      "y": 474
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ゆき",
    "text": "「……まったく話が通じませんね。ふん、今日のところは勘弁してやります」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 38,
    "dress": "old-default",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-default_expression/joyful",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 0,
      "y": 474
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
